{
  "layer": "solution",
  "type": "container",
  "name": "opencode-suite",
  "body": "The `opencode-suite/` distribution — the `apg_*` tools and the shared `lib/apg.ts` plumbing, embedded into the apg binary via `include_str!` and installed by `apg init` into `~/.opencode/`. It is the consumer boundary of the graph: its curated tools read the scanned graph and return results to agents and editors, and it is where a stored repo-relative identity is resolved to an absolute path against the caller's project directory. The already-installed copies (a project's `.opencode/` and the cross-project `~/.opencode/`) are owned by the installed tooling.",
